      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\u2022 Next.js 16 (App Router) \u2014 routing + dev proxy\n\u2022 React 19 + TypeScript 5\n\u2022 Tailwind CSS v4 \u2014 styling\n\u2022 globe.gl + Three.js \u2014 WebGL 3D globe rendering\n\u2022 satellite.js \u2014 client-side SGP4/SDP4 propagation\n\u2022 topojson-client + world-atlas \u2014 country borders\n\u2022 react-icons \u2014 UI icons",
      "originalText": "\u2022 Next.js 16 (App Router) \u2014 routing + dev proxy\n\u2022 React 19 + TypeScript 5\n\u2022 Tailwind CSS v4 \u2014 styling\n\u2022 globe.gl + Three.js \u2014 WebGL 3D globe rendering\n\u2022 satellite.js \u2014 client-side SGP4/SDP4 propagation\n\u2022 topojson-client + world-atlas \u2014 country borders\n\u2022 react-icons \u2014 UI icons",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "containerId": null
