      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\u2022 Java 17\n\u2022 Spring Boot 4 \u2014 WebMVC (REST) + WebFlux (WebClient)\n\u2022 Lombok \u2014 @Builder / @RequiredArgsConstructor / @Slf4j\n\u2022 predict4java \u2014 real SGP4/SDP4 propagation library\n\u2022 RestTemplate \u2014 outbound HTTP to TLE / CelesTrak\n\u2022 Maven (./mvnw) \u2014 build\n\u2022 No database \u2014 in-memory TTL caches only",
      "originalText": "\u2022 Java 17\n\u2022 Spring Boot 4 \u2014 WebMVC (REST) + WebFlux (WebClient)\n\u2022 Lombok \u2014 @Builder / @RequiredArgsConstructor / @Slf4j\n\u2022 predict4java \u2014 real SGP4/SDP4 propagation library\n\u2022 RestTemplate \u2014 outbound HTTP to TLE / CelesTrak\n\u2022 Maven (./mvnw) \u2014 build\n\u2022 No database \u2014 in-memory TTL caches only",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "containerId": null
    },
