      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\u2022 Python 3.10+\n\u2022 FastAPI + Uvicorn \u2014 ASGI web service\n\u2022 Pydantic v2 \u2014 request/response validation\n  (camelCase \u21c4 snake_case field aliases)\n\u2022 scikit-learn \u2014 KMeans, DBSCAN, IsolationForest\n\u2022 NumPy \u2014 feature matrix + StandardScaler\n\u2022 Stateless \u2014 no DB, pure function service",
      "originalText": "\u2022 Python 3.10+\n\u2022 FastAPI + Uvicorn \u2014 ASGI web service\n\u2022 Pydantic v2 \u2014 request/response validation\n  (camelCase \u21c4 snake_case field aliases)\n\u2022 scikit-learn \u2014 KMeans, DBSCAN, IsolationForest\n\u2022 NumPy \u2014 feature matrix + StandardScaler\n\u2022 Stateless \u2014 no DB, pure function service",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "containerId": null
    },
