      "text": "CLIENT-SIDE PROPAGATION LOOP  \u2014  zero network calls",
      "originalText": "CLIENT-SIDE PROPAGATION LOOP  \u2014  zero network calls",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "containerId": null
    },
    {
      "id": "t_de9afb3a1e",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 414,
      "y": 974,
      "width": 1212,
      "height": 52,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#333333",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1521390290,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1297449208,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Every 1\u20135 seconds (interval scales up as satellite count grows, 1s for a few hundred \u2192 5s for 6,000+):\n  satellite.propagate(satrec, now)  +  eciToGeodetic()   \u2192   globe.gl.objectsData([...])\nPaused automatically while the user drags / zooms the globe (220ms idle debounce) so math never fights the frame rate.",
      "originalText": "Every 1\u20135 seconds (interval scales up as satellite count grows, 1s for a few hundred \u2192 5s for 6,000+):\n  satellite.propagate(satrec, now)  +  eciToGeodetic()   \u2192   globe.gl.objectsData([...])\nPaused automatically while the user drags / zooms the globe (220ms idle debounce) so math never fights the frame rate.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "containerId": null
    },
