      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Selects it (max 10 at once). Computes a 90-minute\norbit trail \u2014 180 points, 30s steps \u2014 locally with\nsatellite.js, then adds a dashed line via\nglobe.gl.pathsData(). No backend call.",
