      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Identical satellite fetch + client-side propagation loop as Page 1 \u2014 same component, same code path, no duplication.\nVisual differences only: the globe is scaled down (0.22\u00d7), a Three.js AxesHelper + GridHelper is added to the scene, and a\n392px-wide Orbital Analytics panel appears on the right \u2014 this is where the clustering flow below begins.",
      "originalText": "Identical satellite fetch + client-side propagation loop as Page 1 \u2014 same component, same code path, no duplication.\nVisual differences only: the globe is scaled down (0.22\u00d7), a Three.js AxesHelper + GridHelper is added to the scene, and a\n392px-wide Orbital Analytics panel appears on the right \u2014 this is where the clustering flow below begins.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "containerId": null
    },
