      "text": "LaunchController  GET /api/launches , GET /{id}/trajectory  (stub data: Artemis III, Starship Mars demo)\nTrajectoryController  POST /api/trajectory/plan  (stub: hardcoded, non-physical Earth\u2192Mars path)\nBoth are only exercised by an unused ApiCalls.tsx demo component \u2014 matches the README's \"Mission Planning (Coming Soon).\"",
      "originalText": "LaunchController  GET /api/launches , GET /{id}/trajectory  (stub data: Artemis III, Starship Mars demo)\nTrajectoryController  POST /api/trajectory/plan  (stub: hardcoded, non-physical Earth\u2192Mars path)\nBoth are only exercised by an unused ApiCalls.tsx demo component \u2014 matches the README's \"Mission Planning (Coming Soon).\"",
